config BR2_PACKAGE_GNOME_BACKGROUNDS
	bool "gnome-backgrounds"
	help
	  The default GNOME desktop wallpapers, including the Adwaita
	  set that gsettings-desktop-schemas names as the default
	  background. Without them the shell draws a flat colour.

	  About 38MB of images.

	  https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-backgrounds
